#X text 102 575 Note that even though the non-alphanumeric versions come from a single binary pack \, it is also possible to load them with the "cyclone/" prefix as above. As of Pd 0.57-0 \, the objects above have been deprecated as similar objects have been added to Pd Vanilla (with multichannel support). Hence \, if you load them without the cyclone prefix \, you end up with the Vanilla versions.;
